   "hash": "1d15319c12603aa5",
   "does": "Publishes buffered text to the live turn: skips if empty or <33 ms since last publish (unless forced); drops the buffer if the turn is gone; takes the scrubbed publishable text (complete sentences, or everything on force), appends it, advances the speakable cursor to the full text length when thisRoundIsEmpty and the batch contains a sentence terminator, then saves the conversation.",
